( https://albiononline.com/news/pyromancer-cryomancer )

Adventurer,

The *Pyromancer* and *Cryomancer* have arrived! Available now from the in-g=
ame store, these premium vanity bundles include *full costume sets* along w=
ith matching skins for your *Swiftclaw base mount*.

With the fully reworked *Magic Staffs* in the recent Into the Fray update, =
now is the perfect time to show off your magical specializations. Scorch th=
e earth and leave ashes in your wake with the fearsome *Pyromancer* or free=
ze your foes in their tracks with the *Cryomancer.* Or grab both sets toget=
her at a *discounted price* , and become a master of both fire and ice, und=
efeatable in any fight.

As with past bundles, you can mix and match costume and mount skins with *a=
ll characters on your account* - both male and female - and they are never =
lost or destroyed. So reveal yourself as a master of elemental magic, and s=
end your foes scattering!

( https://albiononline.com/news/undead-challenge-2022 )

The Undead Challenge Returns
----------------------------

The dead just won't stay buried! For the entire month of July, take the *Un=
dead Challenge* ( https://albiononline.com/news/undead-challenge-2022 ) to =
unlock fantastic rewards. Earn points for open-world activities, unlock che=
sts to get valuable loot, and claim your very own *Spectral Direboar*.

As always, you can earn Challenge Points by *gathering, fishing, farming* ,=
 and *killing monsters*. Points count simultaneously toward a daily bonus, =
a weekly unlockable chest, and the monthly mount / avatar ring reward. So l=
og in, head out into the open world, gather points, and claim these rewards=
 while you can!

( https://albiononline.com/news/into-the-fray-patch-2 )

Into the Fray Patch 2 is Here
-----------------------------

*Into the Fray Patch 2* ( https://albiononline.com/changelog/into-the-fray-=
patch-2 ) is live! This patch brings updates to the Crystal League, some si=
gnificant UI and audio improvements, a number of combat balance changes, an=
d more.

For a full rundown of what=E2=80=99s new in this patch, read the official p=
atchnotes:

LEARN MORE ( https://albiononline.com/changelog/into-the-fray-patch-2 )

